  <dsc><c id="3070162502ed114b2a99ab89ea908ce3" level="series"><did><unittitle>Peace and Social Justice Program, Vice President, Bradford K. Smith subject files</unittitle><unitid>1</unitid><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1079568</unitid><physdesc altrender="whole"><extent altrender="materialtype spaceoccupied">0.71 Cubic Feet</extent><extent altrender="carrier">About 1 LGL size Hollinger box and 1 Half-LGL size Hollinger box</extent></physdesc><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1996/2005" type="inclusive">1996-2005</unitdate></did><scopecontent id="302ca6df81a6325e4ad0ea3569aa831d"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Series consists of the subject files of Ford Foundation Peace and Social Justice Program Vice President Bradford K. Smith. Smith's records likely became absorbed into the office files of Ford Democracy, Rights, and Justice Program Vice President Maya Harris through inheritance. The subject files are arranged alphabetically by title and many were created to document the Peace and Social Justice Program's work with a specific organization. There are also files containing organizational information such as staff members' biographies, and a file containing a group of transcripts of Smith's speeches at various meetings and events.</p><p>
